#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:69
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Uvod"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:70
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Based initially on <emphasis>qtwebkit</emphasis> (and currently on "
"<emphasis>kdewebkit</emphasis>), &i18n-rekonq; is a lightweight browser "
"designed to use the <guilabel>WebKit</guilabel> rendering engine in "
"combination with various &kde; technologies, allowing it to integrate "
"seamlessly into the &kde; desktop. The name is a throwback to the venerable "
"khtml-based <ulink url=\"help:/konqueror/index.html\">&konqueror;</ulink> "
"which is currently the default &kde; web browser."
msgstr ""
"Prvenstveno baziran na<emphasis>qtwebkit</emphasis> (a trenutno na "
"<emphasis>kdewebkit</emphasis>), &i18n-rekonq; je jednostavni pretraživač "
"napravljen za korištenje  <guilabel>WebKit</guilabel>za obradu u kombinaciji "
"sa različitim &kde; tehnologijama, dozvoljavajući mu integraciju sa  &kde; "
"desktopom. Ime podsjeća na khtml bazirani <ulink url=\"help:/konqueror/index."
"html\">&konqueror;</ulink>koji je trenutno zadani &kde; internet pretraživač."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:72
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&i18n-rekonq; has already replaced &konqueror; as the default browser in "
"Chakra and &kubuntu;, with more distributions expressing similar intent for "
"their future releases."
msgstr ""
"&i18n-rekonq; je već zamijenio  &konqueror; kao zadani pretraživač u Chakra "
"i &kubuntu;, sa mnogim distribucijama pokazujući sličnu namjeru i sa budućim "
"izdanjima."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:74
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Like all &kde; applications, &i18n-rekonq; is highly configurable. This "
"document describes how &i18n-rekonq; behaves with the normal, default "
"settings."
msgstr ""
"Kao i sve &kde; aplikacije , &i18n-rekonq; se lahko podešava. Ovaj dokument "
"opisuje kako se  &i18n-rekonq; ponaša sa normalnim, zadanim postavkama."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:78
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A three button mouse can be useful when you are running &i18n-rekonq; or any "
"other &kde; application. If your mouse only has two buttons then you should "
"be able to set your system up so that you can simulate a middle mouse button "
"by pressing both buttons at the same time."
msgstr ""
"Miš sa tri tipke može biti koristan kada radite sa  &i18n-rekonq; ili bilo "
"kojom drugom &kde; aplikacijom.Ako vaš miš ima samo dvije tipke onda trebate "
"podesiti sistem tako da možete simulirati srednju tipku istovremenim "
"pritiskanjem dvije postojeće tipke."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:82
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you are used to having to double-click to perform an action, then take "
"care, because in common with the rest of &kde;, &i18n-rekonq; defaults to "
"single-clicking."
msgstr ""
"Ako ste navikli na dupli klik za izvršavanje neke akcije , onda budite "
"pažljivi jer u skladu sa ostatakom &kde;, &i18n-rekonq; zadan je jednostruki "
"klik."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:90
#, no-c-format
msgid "Starting &i18n-rekonq;"
msgstr "Pokretanje  &i18n-rekonq;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:91
#, no-c-format
msgid "&i18n-rekonq; can be started in the following ways"
msgstr "&i18n-rekonq; može biti pokrenut na sljedeće načine"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:94
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"From the application launcher select <menuchoice> <guimenuitem>Applications</"
"guimenuitem> <guisubmenu>Internet</guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>rekonq</"
"guimenuitem> </menuchoice>"
msgstr ""
"Iz aplikacije  <menuchoice> <guimenuitem>Aplikacije </guimenuitem> "
"<guisubmenu>Internet</guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>rekonq</guimenuitem> </"
"menuchoice>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:101
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<keycombo action=\"simul\">&Alt;<keycap>F2</keycap></keycombo> will open "
"&krunner;, type <userinput>rekonq</userinput> (lower case) and press &Enter; "
"to start &i18n-rekonq;"
msgstr ""
"<keycombo action=\"simul\">&Alt;<keycap>F2</keycap></keycombo> će otvoriti "
"&krunner;,unesite <userinput>rekonq</userinput> (mala slova) i "
"pritisnite&Enter; da pokrenete  &i18n-rekonq;"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:107
#, no-c-format
msgid "Interface"
msgstr "Interfejs"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:116
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>&i18n-rekonq; main toolbar</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>&i18n-rekonq; glavna alatna traka</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:119
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>&i18n-rekonq; main toolbar</para>"
msgstr "<para>&i18n-rekonq; glavna alatna traka</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:124
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"By default, the &i18n-rekonq; window uses only one toolbar. This main "
"toolbar consists of four navigation buttons (<guilabel>Back</guilabel>, "
"<guilabel>Forward</guilabel>, <guilabel>Reload/Stop</guilabel>), the &URL; "
"bar and a menu button <guilabel>Tools</guilabel>. This minimalist approach "
"to the main toolbar marks the most significant user-interface departure from "
"the traditional multi-toolbar paradigm followed by most other browsers like "
"&konqueror;."
msgstr ""
"Zadani  &i18n-rekonq; prozor koristi samo jednu alatnu traku. Glavna alatna "
"traka se sastoji od četiri navigacijske tipke(<guilabel>Nazad</guilabel>, "
"<guilabel>Naprijed</guilabel>, <guilabel>Obnovi/Stop</guilabel>),  &URL; "
"liniju i meni tipke <guilabel>Alati</guilabel>. Minimalistički pristup pri "
"kreiranju glavne alatne trake označava najznačajniji prelazak korisničkog "
"interfejsa sa tradicionalnog sa više alatnih traka korištenih u  &konqueror;."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:126
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Further, the main toolbar offers only limited customization &ndash;. This "
"helps keep the &i18n-rekonq; UI simple and puts the focus on the web page on "
"display."
msgstr ""
"Nadalje, glavna alatna traka nudi ograničena podešavanja  &ndash;. Ovo "
"održava  &i18n-rekonq; UI jednostavnim i stavlja fokus na prikaz internet "
"stranice na ekranu."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:136
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>&i18n-rekonq; &URL; bar</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>&i18n-rekonq; &URL; bar</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:139
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>&i18n-rekonq; &URL; bar</para>"
msgstr "<para>&i18n-rekonq; &URL; bar</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:144
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&i18n-rekonq; introduces a vastly improved &URL; bar that offers access to "
"search engines from the drop down completion list itself. The completion "
"list is also populated by matching items from your history and bookmarks."
msgstr ""
"&i18n-rekonq; uvodi dosta poboljšanu  &URL; liniju , koja omogućava pristup "
"pretraživačima iz padajuće liste.Navedena lista sadrži i objekte iz vaše "
"historije i oznaka."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:154
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>&i18n-rekonq; new tab page</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>&i18n-rekonq; nova kartica</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:157
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>&i18n-rekonq; new tab page</para>"
msgstr "<para>&i18n-rekonq; nova kartica</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:162
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When started, &i18n-rekonq; displays the New Tab page, much of which is "
"taken by a set of preview thumbnails of favorite web pages. These thumbnails "
"offer a speedy way for the user to access their most frequently used web "
"pages. There is also a pane at the top of this page allows the user to "
"switch to previews of recently closed tabs and lists of bookmarked web "
"pages, download and browsing histories."
msgstr ""
"Kada je pokrenut ,&i18n-rekonq;  prikazuje novu karticu na kojoj su "
"prikazane ikone  omiljenih internet stranica. Ove ikone nude brži pristup "
"često korištenim internet stranicama.Na vrhu ove stranice prikazana je ploča "
"koja omogućava korisniku pregled nedavno zatvorenih kartica i liste "
"označenih internet stranica ,preuzimanja i pregled historije."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:164
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To get back to the New Tab page, open a new tab or click the <guiicon>Close "
"Tab</guiicon> icon if only one tab is opened."
msgstr ""
"Da biste se vratili na stranicu sa novom karticom pritisnite "
"<guiicon>Zatvori karticu</guiicon> ikonu ako je samo jedna kartica otvorena."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:173
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>&i18n-rekonq; hidden UI elements</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>&i18n-rekonq; sakriveni UI elementi</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:176
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>&i18n-rekonq; hidden UI elements</para>"
msgstr "<para>&i18n-rekonq; sakriveni UI elementi</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:181
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Further configuration options activate several other UI elements hidden by "
"default. These include a toolbar for bookmarks, a panel (a panel, being a "
"mini-window that can be resized, detached or re-docked in the main window) "
"each for bookmarks and history and a web inspector panel (handy for web "
"development)."
msgstr ""
"Daljnja podešavanja aktiviraju određen broj UI elemenata koji su zadano "
"sakriveni.Ovo uključuje alatnu traku za oznake , ploču (ploča, kao mali "
"prozor čija veličina može biti promijenjena i koji može biti zakačen u "
"glavnom prozoru ) svaki za oznake i historiju i ploču za pregled interneta "
"(korisne za razvoj interneta)."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:184
#, no-c-format
msgid "Features"
msgstr "Dodaci"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:185
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Under its minimalist appearance, &i18n-rekonq; packs a full set of powerful "
"features. Some of them are described below:"
msgstr ""
"Unutar svog minimalističkog prikaza &i18n-rekonq; sadrži cijeli set moćnih "
"dodataka.Neki od njih su opisani ispod :"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:187
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kde; integration"
msgstr "&kde; integracija"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:188
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&i18n-rekonq; is designed with the aim of being a &kde; browser. And it "
"shows this."
msgstr ""
"&i18n-rekonq;je dizajniran sa ciljem da bude &kde;pretraživač. On "
"predstavlja ovo."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:190
#, no-c-format
msgid "Appearance"
msgstr "Prikaz"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:191
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"It obeys your themes, fonts, window decoration, menu highlighting, and many "
"personalization options you set for your desktop."
msgstr ""
"On usvaja vaše teme, fontove, podešavanja prozora , isticanje menija , i "
"mnoge druge opcije za personalizaciju vašeg desktopa."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:194
#, no-c-format
msgid "Applications"
msgstr "Aplikacije"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:203
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<phrase>&i18n-rekonq; opens a PDF file in an &okular; <guilabel>kpart</"
"guilabel></phrase>"
msgstr ""
"<phrase>&i18n-rekonq; otvara PDF dokument u  &okular; <guilabel>kpart</"
"guilabel></phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:206
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<para>&i18n-rekonq; opens a PDF file in an &okular; <guilabel>kpart</"
"guilabel></para>"
msgstr ""
"<para>&i18n-rekonq; otvara PDF dokument u &okular; <guilabel>kpart</"
"guilabel></para>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:211
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&i18n-rekonq; plays well with other applications in the &kde; family. &i18n-"
"rekonq; will always use your chosen default applications to handle file "
"types. PDF files, for example will open in an embedded <ulink url=\"help:/"
"okular/index.html\">&okular;</ulink> <guilabel>kpart</guilabel> within &i18n-"
"rekonq; itself. Media files will open in <ulink url=\"help:/dragonplayer/"
"index.html\">&dragon;</ulink> (or any other designated default application "
"for that filetype)."
msgstr ""
"&i18n-rekonq; radi dobro sa drugim aplikacijama  u &kde; porodici. &i18n-"
"rekonq; će uvijek koristiti zadane aplikacije za rad sa datim tipovima "
"dokumenata. PDFdokumenti će, na primjer biti otvoreni  unutar<ulink url="
"\"help:/okular/index.html\">&okular;</ulink> <guilabel>kpart</guilabel> "
"pomoću &i18n-rekonq; . Medijski dokument će biti otvoreni pomoću <ulink url="
"\"help:/dragonplayer/index.html\">&dragon;</ulink> (ili pomoću neke druge "
"aplikacije dizajnirane za taj tip dokumenta )."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:221
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>&i18n-rekonq; shares bookmarks &etc; with &konqueror;</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>&i18n-rekonq; dijeli oznake &etc; sa &konqueror;</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:224
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>&i18n-rekonq; shares bookmarks &etc; with &konqueror;</para>"
msgstr "<para>&i18n-rekonq; dijeli oznake &etc; sa &konqueror;</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:230
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Bookmarks, web shortcuts (more on these later), cookies and authentication "
"information are shared with &konqueror;. You will see the same set of "
"bookmarks from either application and you can log onto a website in "
"&konqueror; and carry on seamlessly if you decide to switch to &i18n-"
"rekonq;. Your passwords are stored securely in <ulink url=\"help:/kwallet/"
"index.html\">KWallet</ulink> and can be used from either &konqueror; or "
"&i18n-rekonq;."
msgstr ""
"Oznake, internet kratice(više o ovome kasnije), kolačići i informacije o "
"autentifikaciji se dijele putem &konqueror;. Isti set oznaka će biti "
"prikazan u obje aplikacije i na internet stranicu se možete logovati u "
"&konqueror; i bez problema nastaviti rad u &i18n-rekonq;. Vaše šifre su "
"sigurno sačuvane u <ulink url=\"help:/kwallet/index.html\">KWallet</ulink>  "
"i mogu biti korištene ili iz &konqueror; ili iz &i18n-rekonq;."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:232
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Your downloads can be optionally handled by <ulink url=\"help:/kget/index."
"html\">KGet</ulink>. Feeds from websites can be saved to &akregator; (or "
"<guilabel>Google Reader</guilabel>)."
msgstr ""
"Preuzimanje možete opcionalno vršiti putem <ulink url=\"help:/kget/index.html"
"\">KGet</ulink>. Dodaci sa internet stranica mogu biti sačuvani u "
"&akregator; (ili u <guilabel>Google Čitač</guilabel>)."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:242
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>&i18n-rekonq; + &akregator;</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>&i18n-rekonq; + &akregator;</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:245
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>&i18n-rekonq; + &akregator;</para>"
msgstr "<para>&i18n-rekonq; + &akregator;</para>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:258
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>&i18n-rekonq; + &kget;</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>&i18n-rekonq; + &kget;</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:261
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>&i18n-rekonq; + &kget;</para>"
msgstr "<para>&i18n-rekonq; + &kget;</para>"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:268
#, no-c-format
msgid "Services"
msgstr "Uslužni programi"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:269
#, no-c-format
msgid "KIO support"
msgstr "KIO podrška"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:278
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>&i18n-rekonq; browsing an &FTP; share</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>&i18n-rekonq; pretraživanje &FTP; share</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:281
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>&i18n-rekonq; browsing an &FTP; share</para>"
msgstr "<para>&i18n-rekonq; pretraživanje &FTP; share</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:286
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&i18n-rekonq; supports KIO services, including cookies, cache, proxies and "
"network settings. <emphasis>KIO-slaves</emphasis> like file:/, ftp:/, man:/, "
"help:/, info:/ &etc; will work in &i18n-rekonq;, too."
msgstr ""
"&i18n-rekonq; podržava KIO uslužne programe, uključujući kolačiće, keš, "
"proksije i mrežne postavke. <emphasis>KIO-robovi</emphasis> kao dokumenti:/, "
"ftp:/, man:/, help:/, info:/ &etc; će raditi u &i18n-rekonq;, također."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:289
#, no-c-format
msgid "Dialogs"
msgstr "Okviri"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:290
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In addition to all this, &i18n-rekonq; uses &kde;'s own file dialog for "
"opening/saving documents. This means, you have access to the "
"<emphasis>Places</emphasis> navigation panel from &dolphin; while you open "
"or save documents."
msgstr ""
"Kao dodatak svemu ovome  &i18n-rekonq; koristi &kde;-ov okvir za otvaranje/"
"spremanje dokumenata. Ovo znači da vi imate pristup <emphasis>Mjesta</"
"emphasis> navigacionom panelu iz <emphasis>Places</emphasis> dok otvarate "
"ili spremate dokumente."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:292
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Thus, &i18n-rekonq; looks, feels and behaves like a part of your &kde; "
"desktop."
msgstr "&i18n-rekonq; izgleda i ponaša se kao dio vašeg &kde; desktopa."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:297
#, no-c-format
msgid "Webkit engine"
msgstr "Pogon Internet alata Webkit"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:298
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&i18n-rekonq; uses the open source <guilabel>WebKit</guilabel> rendering "
"engine which incidentally began life as a branch of the khtml/kjs libraries "
"from the &kde; project. <guilabel>WebKit</guilabel> is fast, powerful and "
"used by many other popular browsers today including <trademark class="
"\"registered\">Google</trademark>'s <trademark class=\"registered\">Chrome</"
"trademark>, <trademark class=\"registered\">Apple</trademark>'s <trademark "
"class=\"registered\">Safari</trademark> and others."
msgstr ""
"&i18n-rekonq; koristi pogon <guilabel>Internetalat</guilabel> koji je "
"slučajno kreiran kao dio khtml/kjs biblioteka u &kde; projektu. "
"<guilabel>WebKit</guilabel> je brz , moćan i korišten od strane mnogih "
"drugih popularnih pretraživača uključujući i <trademark class=\"registered"
"\">Google</trademark>'s <trademark class=\"registered\">Chrome</trademark>, "
"<trademark class=\"registered\">Apple</trademark>'s <trademark class="
"\"registered\">Safari</trademark> i drugi."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:301
#, no-c-format
msgid "Auto-load/click-to-load plugins"
msgstr "Auto učitavanje/pritisnite za učitavanje nadogradnje"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:310
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<phrase>&i18n-rekonq; demonstrating the click-to-load-plugins feature on "
"youtube.com</phrase>"
msgstr ""
"<phrase>&i18n-rekonq; demonstracija korištenja pritisni za učitavanje "
"nadogradnje efekta na youtube.com</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:313
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<para>&i18n-rekonq; demonstrating the click-to-load-plugins feature on "
"youtube.com</para>"
msgstr ""
"<para>&i18n-rekonq; demonstracija korištenja pritisni za učitavanje "
"nadogradnje efekta na youtube.com</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:318
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"One of the benefits of using the <guilabel>WebKit</guilabel> engine, is that "
"plugins can be disabled from automatically loading. This comes in handy to "
"surf websites fast, without being bogged down by <guilabel>flash</guilabel> "
"plugins. In the so-called <emphasis>Click-to-load</emphasis> mode, you will "
"instead see a button that you can click on to activate the plugin."
msgstr ""
"Jedna od prednosti korištenja <guilabel>WebKit</guilabel> pogona, je da "
"automatsko učitavanje nadogradnje može biti onemogućeno. Ovo  je korisno za "
"brzo pregledanje internet stranica, bez mogućnosti da budete zaustavljeni od "
"strane <guilabel>flash</guilabel> dodataka. U takozvanom <emphasis>Pritisni-"
"za-učitavanje</emphasis> modu, biće prikazana tipka koju trebate pritisnuti "
"za učitavanje nadogradnje."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:321
#, no-c-format
msgid "Adblock support"
msgstr "Podrška za blokadu oglasa"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:330
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>&i18n-rekonq; blocking images on kde-apps.org</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>&i18n-rekonq; blokira fotografije na kde-apps.org</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:333
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>&i18n-rekonq; blocking images on kde-apps.org</para>"
msgstr "<para>&i18n-rekonq; blokira fotografije na kde-apps.org</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:338
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&i18n-rekonq; comes with an automatic subscription to the Easylist filter, "
"which is updated every week. Additionally, you can set up manual filters to "
"block loading of elements from web pages that match your criteria. You can "
"even download and import additional published filterlists or export your "
"list for backup."
msgstr ""
"&i18n-rekonq; dolazi sa automatskom pretplatom za Easylist filter, koji se "
"obnavlja svake sedmice. Dodatno, možete ručno postaviti filtere za "
"blokiranje učitavanja elemenata sa internet stranica koji odgovaraju vašim "
"uslovima. Čak možete i preuzeti i ugraditi dodatnu listu filtera ili "
"isčitati vašu listu za podršku."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:342
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For detailed information please read <ulink url=\"help:/kcontrol/khtml-"
"adblock/index.html\">AdBlocK Filters</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"Za detaljne informacije pročitajte <ulink url=\"help:/kcontrol/khtml-adblock/"
"index.html\">Filteri za blokadu oglasa</ulink>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:344
#, no-c-format
msgid "Web shortcuts support"
msgstr "Podška internet kraticama"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:345
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&i18n-rekonq; allows you to pick from an extensive list of web shortcuts "
"&ndash; these are keywords that allow you to search the web quickly. For "
"instance, entering <userinput>gg:&kde;</userinput> in the location bar will "
"search <emphasis>Google</emphasis> for <quote>&kde;</quote>, while "
"<userinput>wp:&kde;</userinput> will search <emphasis>Wikipedia</emphasis> "
"for <quote>&kde;</quote>. There are dozens of these defined by default. You "
"can edit these or even define custom shortcuts to search on your favorite "
"websites."
msgstr ""
"&i18n-rekonq; vam dozvoljava da iz dugačke liste internet kratica odaberete "
"&ndash; koji predstavljaju ključne riječi za brzo pretraživanje interneta. "
"Na primjer ako unesete <userinput>gg:&kde;</userinput> u lokacijsku liniju "
"pretraživati će se <emphasis>Google</emphasis> za <quote>&kde;</quote>, dok "
"<userinput>wp:&kde;</userinput> će pretraživati <emphasis>Wikipedia</"
"emphasis> za <quote>&kde;</quote>. Desetine njih je definirano ranije. "
"Možete urediti ove ili definisati nove kratice da pretražujete omiljene "
"internet stranice."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:347
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For detailed information please read <ulink url=\"help:/kcontrol/ebrowsing/"
"index.html\">Web Shortcuts</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"Za detaljne informacije pročitajte <ulink url=\"help:/kcontrol/ebrowsing/"
"index.html\">Internet kratice</ulink>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:349
#, no-c-format
msgid "Privacy and security features"
msgstr "Dodaci za privatnost i sigurnost"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:358
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>&i18n-rekonq; in private browsing mode</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>&i18n-rekonq; u modu privatnog pretraživanja</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:361
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>&i18n-rekonq; in private browsing mode</para>"
msgstr "<para>&i18n-rekonq; u modu privatnog pretraživanja </para>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:366
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&i18n-rekonq; allows users to browse the web without retaining information "
"about the visited pages in your history. Note that this feature does not "
"necessarily make you anonymous on the Internet &ndash; it only prevents "
"fresh information from being recorded on your computer. You can also delete "
"your history, cookies and other private data anytime straight from the "
"configuration menu button."
msgstr ""
"&i18n-rekonq; dozvoljava korisnicima pretraživanje interneta bez pamćenja "
"informacija o posjećenim stranicama u historiji. Ovaj dodatak vas ne čini "
"anonimnim na Internetu &ndash; već samo spriječava da se informacije "
"sačuvaju na vaš računar. Također možete izbrisati historiju, kolačiće i "
"druge privatne podatke u bilo kojem trenutku u konfiguracjskom meniju."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:376
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>&i18n-rekonq; &URL; bar showing the SSL info icon</phrase>"
msgstr ""
"<phrase>&i18n-rekonq; &URL; linija koja prikazuje SSL info ikonu </phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:379
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>&i18n-rekonq; &URL; bar showing the SSL info icon</para>"
msgstr "<para>&i18n-rekonq; &URL; linija koja prikazuje SSL info ikonu</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:384
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When viewing web pages over a secure connection, you can also view SSL "
"information straight from the &URL; bar by clicking on the <guiicon>yellow "
"lock</guiicon> icon."
msgstr ""
"Kada posjećujete internet stranicu preko sigurne veze, informacije o SSL "
"možete vidjeti direktno u &URL; liniji pritiskom na <guiicon>yellow lock</"
"guiicon> ikonu."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:387
#, no-c-format
msgid "Advanced tab handling"
msgstr "Napredno upravljanje karticama"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:396
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>&i18n-rekonq; showing a preview of a tab on hover</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>&i18n-rekonq; pokazuje prikaz kartice na naslovnici</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:399
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>&i18n-rekonq; showing a preview of a tab on hover</para>"
msgstr "<para>&i18n-rekonq; pokazuje prikaz kartice na naslovnici</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:404
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&i18n-rekonq; allows you to rearrange your tabs on the fly. Just drag a tab "
"to the left or to the right and the other tabs will move out of your way. "
"You can also hover over a tab to see a live preview of the web page being "
"displayed there."
msgstr ""
"&i18n-rekonq; dozvoljava ponovno uređenje kartica. Samo prevucite karticu "
"lijevo ili desno i ostale kartice će se skloniti s puta. Također možete "
"preći pokazivačem preko kartice i imaćete prikaz internet stranice koja je "
"prikazana u datoj kartici."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:406
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A <emphasis>context menu</emphasis> (right-click menu) gives access to more "
"tab-related functions such as the ability to detach, clone, reload the tab."
msgstr ""
"<emphasis>context menu</emphasis>(meni za desni klik) dozvoljava pristup "
"više kartica-povezanim funkcijama kao što su mogućnost razdvajanja, "
"dupliciranja, osvježavanja kartice."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:409
#, no-c-format
msgid "Session restore feature"
msgstr "Dodatak za oporavak sesije"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:410
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If &i18n-rekonq; crashes, it will automatically attempt to restore your "
"session, complete with all the tabs the next time you start it. If for some "
"reason, the browser continues to crash upon restoring the session, &i18n-"
"rekonq; will automatically start with a fresh session the second time."
msgstr ""
"Ako &i18n-rekonq; padne, automatski će pokušati da vrati vašu sesiju, sa "
"svim karticama, kada ga slijedeći put pokrenete. Ako iz nekog razloga "
"pretraživač nastavi da pada sa povratkom sesije, &i18n-rekonq; će automatski "
"započeti novu sesiju drugi put."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:413
#, no-c-format
msgid "Full screen mode"
msgstr "Režim preko cijelog ekrana"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:414
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&i18n-rekonq; supports full-screening the web page straight from the "
"configuration menu button or through a keyboard shortcut (<keycombo>&Ctrl;"
"&Shift;<keycap>F</keycap></keycombo>, by default). In the full screen view, "
"the main toolbar will auto-hide and the web page will be displayed over your "
"entire screen."
msgstr ""
"&i18n-rekonq; podržava pregled internet stranice preko cijelog ekrana iz "
"tipke konfiguracijskog menija  ili preko kratice na tastaturi\r\n"
"(<keycombo>&Ctrl;&Shift;<keycap>F</keycap></keycombo>, by default). U "
"pregledu preko cijelog ekrana, glavna alatna traka će se automatski skloniti "
"i internet stranica će biti prikazana preko cijelog ekrana."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:447
#, no-c-format
msgid "Detailed &i18n-rekonq; configuration"
msgstr "Detaljna &i18n-rekonq; konfiguracija"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:451
#, no-c-format
msgid "General settings of &i18n-rekonq;"
msgstr "Opšte postavke of &i18n-rekonq;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:453
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You want to configure the general behavior of &i18n-rekonq;? You found the "
"right place to get it explained."
msgstr ""
"Želite da postavite općenito ponašanje &i18n-rekonq;? Našli ste pravo mjesto "
"za objašnjenje postupka."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:457
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To open the general settings click on the <guiicon>Tools</guiicon> icon and "
"select <guisubmenu>Configure rekonq</guisubmenu>."
msgstr ""
"Za otvaranje opštih postavki pritisnite <guiicon>Alati</guiicon> ikonu i "
"odaberite <guisubmenu>Podesi rekonq</guisubmenu>."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:464 index.docbook:585 index.docbook:660 index.docbook:680
#: index.docbook:703
#, no-c-format
msgid "Now you should see this"
msgstr "Sada biste trebali vidjeti slijedeće"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:470 index.docbook:531 index.docbook:591 index.docbook:666
#: index.docbook:686 index.docbook:709
#, no-c-format
msgid "Screenshot"
msgstr "Snimak ekrana"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:476
#, no-c-format
msgid "Here a List of configurable points and explanation for it:"
msgstr "Ovdje je lista konfiguracijskih tačaka i objašnjenje za njih:"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:481
#, no-c-format
msgid "When starting rekonq:"
msgstr "Pri pokretanju rekonq:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:482
#, no-c-format
msgid "You can configure what &i18n-rekonq; should do on startup."
msgstr "Možete podesiti šta bi &i18n-rekonq; trebao raditi pri pokretanju."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:485
#, no-c-format
msgid "Home page &URL;:"
msgstr "Početna stranica &URL;:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:486
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can either set your home page directly through tipping the &URL; in."
msgstr "Možete podesiti početnu stranicu direktno, tipkanjem &URL;."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:489
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use the New Tab Page as home page"
msgstr "Korištenje Nove kartice kao početne stranice"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:490
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Enabling this option makes an empty new page the default home page of &i18n-"
"rekonq;."
msgstr ""
"Omogućavanje ovo opcije postavlja praznu stranicu kao zadanu početnu "
"stranicu za &i18n-rekonq;."

#. Tag: guibutton
#: index.docbook:493
#, no-c-format
msgid "Set to Current Page"
msgstr "Postavi na tekuću stranicu"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:494
#, no-c-format
msgid "Sets your home page to the one you are visiting at the moment."
msgstr "Postavlja za vašu početnu stranicu onu na kojoj ste trenutno."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:497
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use KGet for downloading files"
msgstr "Preuzimaj datoteke KGet-om"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:498
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This activates the &kget; download integration. If this is active &i18n-"
"rekonq; will download everything through &kget;"
msgstr ""
"Ovo aktivira &kget; integraciju preuzimanja. Ako je ovo aktivirano &i18n-"
"rekonq; sve će biti preuzeto putem &kget;"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:501
#, no-c-format
msgid "List links with KGet"
msgstr "Izlista poveznice sa K-getom"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:502
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If enabled, &i18n-rekonq; will display an additional context menu entry, "
"which, when selected, lists all available links of the current website in "
"&kget;."
msgstr ""
"Ako je omogućen, &i18n-rekonq; će u dodatku prikazati meni koji, kada je "
"označen, izlista sve dostupne internet stranice u &kget;."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:512
#, no-c-format
msgid "Configure the Tabs settings"
msgstr "Podešavanja Kartica"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:514
#, no-c-format
msgid "Here you learn how to change the settings for tabs."
msgstr "Ovdje ćete biti upoznati sa načinom promjene postavki za kartice."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:516
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To come to the dialog click on the <guiicon>Tools</guiicon> icon and open "
"<menuchoice> <guisubmenu>Configure rekonq</guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Tabs</"
"guimenuitem> </menuchoice>"
msgstr ""
"Da pristupite okviru pritisnite <guiicon>Alati</guiicon> ikonu i otvorite "
"<menuchoice> <guisubmenu>Postavi rekonq</guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Kartice</"
"guimenuitem> </menuchoice>"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:525
#, no-c-format
msgid "Now this dialog should appear"
msgstr "Sada bi se trebao pojaviti ovakav okvir"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:537
#, no-c-format
msgid "Here a list of configurable points and explanation for it:"
msgstr "Ovo je lista tačaka koje je moguće podešavati i objašnjenja za njih:"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:542
#, no-c-format
msgid "New tab opens"
msgstr "Otvaranje nove kartice"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:543
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here you can choose the default behavior of &i18n-rekonq; when you open the "
"new tab."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje možete odabrati  zadano ponašanje &i18n-rekonq; kada otvorite novu "
"karticu."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:546
#, no-c-format
msgid "New Tab Page starts with"
msgstr "Nova Kartca započinje sa"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:547
#, no-c-format
msgid "Here you can choose the default contents for the new tabs."
msgstr "Ovdje možete odabrati zadane sadržaje novih kartica."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:550
#, no-c-format
msgid "When hovering a tab show"
msgstr "Pregled kartica"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:551
#, no-c-format
msgid "Here you can choose to show a preview, the title, the &URL; or nothing."
msgstr "Ovdje možete odabrati pregeld,naslov,  &URL; ili ništa."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:554
#, no-c-format
msgid "Open as new window when &URL; is called externally"
msgstr "Otvra novi prozor kada je &URL; pozvan izvana"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:555
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This prevents &i18n-rekonq; to open links from external applications in an "
"already running instance in another virtual desktop or activity, but opens "
"them in the actual virtual desktop or activity in new windows instead."
msgstr ""
"Ovo spriječava &i18n-rekonq; da otvara vanjske aplikacije u već pokrenutoj "
"aplikaciji u nekom virtualnom desktopu ili aktivnosti, ali ih otvara u "
"trentnom virtualnom desktopu ili aktivnosti u novom prozoru."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:558
#, no-c-format
msgid "Closing last tab closes window"
msgstr "Zatvaranje posljednje kartice zatvara prozor"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:559
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This forces &i18n-rekonq; to quit, when you close the last tab. If disabled, "
"the view will switch to the New Tab content."
msgstr ""
"Ovo prisiljava &i18n-rekonq; da se zatvori, kada je zatvorena posljednja "
"kartica. Ako je onemogućeno pregled će se promjenjiti u sadržaj Nove kartice."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:562
#, no-c-format
msgid "Activate previously used tab when closing the current one"
msgstr "Vrati na prethodno pregledanu karticu po zatvaranju tekuće"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:563
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This makes &i18n-rekonq; storing your last opened tab and if you close your "
"current one it will reopen the old one. This also can be useful if you use "
"many tabs."
msgstr ""
"Ovo omogućava da &i18n-rekonq; spremi  posljednju karticu koju ste otvarali "
"tako da kada zatvorite trenutnu otvara staru karticu. Ovo može biti korisno "
"ako koristite veliki broj kartica."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:566
#, no-c-format
msgid "Open new tabs next to current tab"
msgstr "Otvara nove kartice pored trenutne kartice"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:567
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This makes it to default that tabs are opened next to the currently active "
"one when you open a link on a page from the context menu in a new tab."
msgstr ""
"Ovo omogućava da se zada otvaranje kartica pored trenutno aktivne i kada "
"otvorite link na stranici na kojoj ste trenutno isti bude otvoren u novoj "
"kartici."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:570
#, no-c-format
msgid "Open new tabs in the foreground"
msgstr "Otvara nove kartice na naslovnoj stranici"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:571
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This makes &i18n-rekonq; switching to new tabs when you open a link on a "
"page from the context menu in a new tab."
msgstr ""
"Ovo omogućava da &i18n-rekonq; prebacuje na novu karticu kada otvorite link "
"u novoj kartici."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:575
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The last two options do not apply for new tabs opened from the tab context "
"menu or using the <guiicon>New Tab</guiicon> icon."
msgstr ""
"Posljednje dvije opcije se na primjenjuju na kartice otvorene standardnim "
"putem korištenjem <guiicon>Nova kartica</guiicon> ikonu."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:581
#, no-c-format
msgid "Configure the Appearance settings"
msgstr "Postavke izgleda"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:597
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Following will explain the configurable things and what they do on the "
"<guilabel>Fonts</guilabel> pane."
msgstr ""
"Nastavak će objasniti  stvari koje je mogće podešavati i šta one rade  na "
"<guilabel>Fonts</guilabel>  ploči."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:602
#, no-c-format
msgid "Standard font"
msgstr "Standardni font"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:603
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here you can set your default font. The first part is the name of the font "
"followed by the size of the font."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje možete podesiti zadani font. Prvi dio imena je naziv fonta a drugi dio "
"je veličina fonta."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:606
#, no-c-format
msgid "Fixed font"
msgstr "Fiksirani font"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:607
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here you can set your font for &i18n-rekonq; labels. The same synopsis like "
"<guilabel>Standard font</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
