#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:730
#, no-c-format
msgid "How do I set &i18n-rekonq; as my default browser?"
msgstr "Kako postaviti &i18n-rekonq; kao moj zadani pretraživač?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:731
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Head to <menuchoice><guimenu>System Settings</guimenu><guimenuitem>Default "
"Applications</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. Here, click on <guilabel>Web "
"Browser</guilabel> to set your default browser. Select to open http and "
"https &URL;s in the following browser and enter <userinput>rekonq %u</"
"userinput> as the browser. Click <guilabel>Apply</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"Za početak <menuchoice><guimenu>Sistemske postavke</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Zadane aplikacije</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. Ovdje "
"pritisnite <guilabel>Internet pretraživač</guilabel> da postavite zadani "
"pretraživač. Odaberite za otvaranje http i https &URL;s u slijedećem "
"pretraživaču <userinput>rekonq %u</userinput> kao preraživač. Pritisnite "
"<guilabel>Primjeni</guilabel>."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:741
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Setting &i18n-rekonq; as the default web browser</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Postavljanje &i18n-rekonq; kao zadanog pretraživača </phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:744
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>Setting &i18n-rekonq; as the default web browser</para>"
msgstr "<para>Postavljanje &i18n-rekonq; kao zadanog pretraživača </para>"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:750
#, no-c-format
msgid "How do I load flash on demand?"
msgstr "Kako da učitam flash na zahtijev?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:751
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click on the <guilabel>Tools</guilabel> menu button, and open the "
"<guilabel>Configure rekonq</guilabel> dialog. Click on <guilabel>WebKit</"
"guilabel> and under <guilabel>Plugin settings</guilabel>, select to "
"<guilabel>Manually Load Plugins</guilabel>. Click <guilabel>OK</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"Pritisnite <guilabel>Alati</guilabel> tipku, i otvorite "
"<guilabel>Konfiguriraj rekonq</guilabel> okvir. Pritisnite "
"<guilabel>Internetalati</guilabel> i u <guilabel>Postavke plugina</"
"guilabel>, odabrite <guilabel>Ručno učitavanje plugina</guilabel>. "
"Pritisnite <guilabel>OK</guilabel>."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:761
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<phrase>Setting &i18n-rekonq; to not automatically load plugins</phrase>"
msgstr ""
"<phrase>Pstavite &i18n-rekonq; da ne učitava automatski plugine</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:764
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>Setting &i18n-rekonq; to not automatically load plugins</para>"
msgstr "<para>Pstavite &i18n-rekonq; da ne učitava automatski plugine</para>"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:770
#, no-c-format
msgid "How do I enable Adblock?"
msgstr "Kako omogućiti Blokiranje reklama?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:771
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Adblocking should already be enabled for you using the <guilabel>Easylist</"
"guilabel> adblock subscription. You can further configure it by clicking on "
"the configuration menu button and choosing <menuchoice><guisubmenu>Tools</"
"guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Ad Block</guimenuitem> </menuchoice> to open "
"<guilabel>Ad Block Settings</guilabel> dialog. Click on <guilabel>Manual "
"Filters</guilabel>. Here, you can add custom filters using wildcard strings "
"(e.g. <command>http://www.site.com/ads/*</command>) or regular expressions "
"within forward slashes (e.g. <userinput>//(ads|dclk)\\./</userinput>)."
msgstr ""
"Blokiranje reklama bi trebalo biti omogućeno <guilabel>Jednostavnalista</"
"guilabel> pretplata za blokiranje reklama. Možete ga dodatno podestit u "
"konfiguracijskom meniju tako da odaberete <menuchoice><guisubmenu>Alati </"
"guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Blokiranje reklama</guimenuitem> </menuchoice> da "
"otvorite <guilabel>Postavke blokiranje reklama</guilabel> dijalogu. "
"Pritisnite <guilabel>Ručni filteri</guilabel>. Ovdje možete dodati željene "
"filtere (npr. <command>http://www.site.com/ads/*</command>) ili standardne "
"izraze unutar kosih crta (npr. <userinput>//(ads|dclk)\\./</userinput>)."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:773
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Clicking <guilabel>OK</guilabel> activates your adblock filters instantly."
msgstr ""
"Pritiskanje <guilabel>OK</guilabel> odmah aktivira vaše filtere za "
"blokiranje reklama."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:783
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>&i18n-rekonq; AdBlocK (automatic) configuration</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>&i18n-rekonq; Postavke automatskog blokiranja reklama</phrase>"

