#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:850
#, no-c-format
msgid "How to obtain &i18n-rekonq;"
msgstr "Kako pokrenuti &i18n-rekonq;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:851
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Stable Packages of &i18n-rekonq; can be downloaded via standard repositories "
"of your distribution"
msgstr ""
"Stabilne verzije &i18n-rekonq; se mogu preuzeti sa standardnih stranica "
"vašeg distributera"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:853
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You also can compile &i18n-rekonq; yourself see <link linkend=\"compilation"
"\">Compilation and Installation</link> for that."
msgstr ""
"Možete doprinijeti &i18n-rekonq; i lično, pogledajte <link linkend="
"\"compilation\">Instalacija</link> for that."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:857
#, no-c-format
msgid "Requirements"
msgstr "Zahtjevi"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:859
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In order to successfully use &i18n-rekonq;, you need at least &Qt; 4.8.x and "
"&kde; 4.8.4."
msgstr ""
"Za pravilnu upotrebu &i18n-rekonq;, trbate najmanje &Qt; 4.8.x i &kde; 4.8.4."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:863
#, no-c-format
msgid "Compilation and Installation"
msgstr "Sastavljanje i instalacija"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:864
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you wish to compile &i18n-rekonq;, you have to install the headers of "
"kdelibs and you need git and the build essentials installed."
msgstr ""
"Ako želite sastaviti &i18n-rekonq;, trebate instalirati osnove kdelibs i "
"trebate git i build osnove imati instalirane."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:866
#, no-c-format
msgid "Under Debian/&ubuntu; you get those through running"
msgstr "Pod Debian/&ubuntu; te možete dobiti kroz pokretanje"

#. Tag: userinput
#: index.docbook:869
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<command>sudo</command> <command>apt-get</command> <option>install</option> "
"<parameter>build-essential kdelibs5-dev git-core</parameter>"
msgstr ""
"<command>sudo</command> <command>apt-get</command> <option>install</option> "
"<parameter>build-essential kdelibs5-dev git-core</parameter>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:874
#, no-c-format
msgid "Under OpenSuse you get those through running"
msgstr "Pod OpenSuse te možete dobiti kroz pokretanje"

#. Tag: userinput
#: index.docbook:876
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<command>sudo</command> <command>zypper</command> <option>in</option> "
"<parameter>libkde4-devel git-core gcc gcc-c++ make cmake</parameter>"
msgstr ""
"<command>sudo</command> <command>zypper</command> <option>in</option> "
"<parameter>libkde4-devel git-core gcc gcc-c++ make cmake</parameter>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:881
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"We will be using git, as the most recent code is available on the git "
"repository. The &kde; Projects web page for &i18n-rekonq; can be found "
"<ulink url=\"https://projects.kde.org/projects/extragear/network/rekonq"
"\">here</ulink>. Stable releases, can also be downloaded <ulink url=\"http://"
"sourceforge.net/projects/rekonq/files/\">here</ulink> in form of tarballs."
msgstr ""
"Koristićemo git , kako je posljednji kod dostupan na git repozitoriju. &kde; "
"Internet stranica sa prijektima &i18n-rekonq; može biti nađen na <ulink url="
"\"https://projects.kde.org/projects/extragear/network/rekonq\">here</ulink>. "
"Stabilne verzije mogu biti preuzete sa <ulink url=\"http://sourceforge.net/"
"projects/rekonq/files/\">here</ulink> u formi tarballs."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:885
#, no-c-format
msgid "Now we need to checkout the latest code. To do so, in a terminal run:"
msgstr ""
"Sada je potrebno pregledati posljednji kod. Da to uradite, u terminal "
"unesite:"

#. Tag: userinput
#: index.docbook:890
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<command>git</command> <option>clone</option> <parameter>git://git.kde.org/"
"rekonq</parameter>"
msgstr ""
"<command>git</command> <option>clone</option> <parameter>git://git.kde.org/"
"rekonq</parameter>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:895
#, no-c-format
msgid "To compile the code type in the following"
msgstr "Za sastavljanje koda unesite slijedeće"

#. Tag: userinput
#: index.docbook:900
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<command>cd</command> <parameter>directory_where_rekonq_source_code_is</"
"parameter>"
msgstr ""
"<command>cd</command> <parameter>directory_where_rekonq_source_code_is</"
"parameter>"

#. Tag: userinput
#: index.docbook:906
#, no-c-format
msgid "<command>mkdir</command> <parameter>build</parameter>"
msgstr "<command>mkdir</command> <parameter>build</parameter>"

#. Tag: userinput
#: index.docbook:912
#, no-c-format
msgid "<command>cd</command> <parameter>build</parameter>"
msgstr "<command>cd</command> <parameter>build</parameter>"

#. Tag: userinput
#: index.docbook:918
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<command>cmake</command> <option>-DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=`<command>kde4-"
"config</command> <option>--prefix</option>`</option> <parameter>..</"
"parameter>"
msgstr ""
"<command>cmake</command> <option>-DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=`<command>kde4-"
"config</command> <option>--prefix</option>`</option> <parameter>..</"
"parameter>"

#. Tag: userinput
#: index.docbook:930
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<command>sudo</command> <command>make</command> <parameter>install</"
"parameter>"
msgstr ""
"<command>sudo</command> <command>make</command> <parameter>install</"
"parameter>"
